<div class="section-shell">
<div class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-8 border-b border-white/15 pb-10 md:flex-row md:items-end">
<div><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.24em] text-accent">Independent full-stack developer</p><p class="mt-3 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/55">ERP systems, custom web applications, integrations, and dependable product delivery from Indonesia.</p></div>
<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-sm font-semibold"><a class="transition hover:text-accent" href="mailto:brianalviano.official@gmail.com">Email</a><a class="transition hover:text-accent" href="https://github.com/brianalviano" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">GitHub</a><a class="transition hover:text-accent" href="https://linkedin.com/in/brianalviano" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a><a class="transition hover:text-accent" href="https://instagram.com/vinnoo_" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Instagram</a><a class="transition hover:text-accent" href="#home">Back to top ↑</a></div>
</div>
<a aria-label="Back to top" class="footer-name group relative mt-5 block overflow-hidden py-3" href="#home">
<span class="display block whitespace-nowrap text-center text-[clamp(3.6rem,13.4vw,13rem)] font-bold leading-none tracking-[-.075em] text-white/95">BRIAN ALVIANO</span>
<span aria-hidden="true" class="footer-shine display pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 block whitespace-nowrap py-3 text-center text-[clamp(3.6rem,13.4vw,13rem)] font-bold leading-none tracking-[-.075em]">BRIAN ALVIANO</span>
</a>
<div class="mt-6 flex flex-col justify-between gap-3 border-t border-white/15 pt-6 text-xs text-white/40 sm:flex-row sm:items-center"><p>© <span id="year"></span> Brian Alviano. All rights reserved.</p><p>HTML · Tailwind CSS 4 · Tabler Icons · GSAP</p></div>
